Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.79,0:00:03.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.48,0:01:03.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（现在）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:07.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（红洛奇 蒙大纳）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第3集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.79,0:00:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想爸爸想让我们继续他的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he wants us to pick up where he left off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,救助他人 猎杀恶魔 家族事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people, hunting things. Family business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不明白为什么你就如此相信他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand the blind faith you have in the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.26,0:00:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,做儿子的本应如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called being a good son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快点给我消失 你再也无法控制我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just pissed off you couldn't control me anymore!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你的儿子们能知道爸爸是多么爱他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only your boys knew how much their daddy loved them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有跟你说过什么吗 - 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he say anything to you? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在追查爸爸的死因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dealing with Dad's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.41,0:02:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 你听听她的歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woo! Listen to her purr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.13,0:02:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会觉得从来没有 听到过如此甜美的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever heard anything so sweet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你对唱这歌的这妞有兴趣 直接跟我说就得了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you two wanna get a room, just let me know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:02:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 宝贝 别理他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't listen to him, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本不了解我们的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't understand us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看上去心情不错啊 - 为什么我得心情不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're in a good mood. - Why shouldn't I be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.47,0:03:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没什么 - 我现在有车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No reason. - I got my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.81,0:03:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有事做 一切看上去都还不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a case. Things are looking up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.31,0:03:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只不过是听说有些牛 还有人离奇死亡而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give you a couple of severed heads and a pile of dead cows…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就乐成这傻样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're Mr. Sunshine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,离红客栈市还有多远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far to Red Lodge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概还有300里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About another 300 miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶杀案的调查正在进行 我只能告诉你们这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The murder investigation is ongoing. That's all I can share with the press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 我们理解 我们只是来记录事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, we understand that. But just for the record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你上周发现了第一具断头尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found the first head last week…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …correct? - Uh - huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有接下来的那名叫 克里斯蒂娜·福来明的女子的尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and the other, a Christina Flanagan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是两天前的事 - 然后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was two days ago. Then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 伙计们 时间到了 我们就说到这里吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Boys.time's up. We're done here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.85,0:03:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那些牛又是怎么回事 - 你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the cattle? - Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近有发现很多牛离奇死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cows found dead…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤口撕裂 却没有血液{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}split open, drained, over a dozen cases?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你不觉得这些之间有关联吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't think there's a connection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,关联到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connection with…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,最早的那些死掉的牛和{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, cattle mutilations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的两起谋杀案 有点象是某些祭祀仪式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, two murders. Kind of sounds like ritual stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就象是祭魔仪式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like satanic cult ritual stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.21,0:04:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们不是在开玩笑吧 - 当然不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not kidding. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没有牛被故意杀掉这回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those cows aren't being mutilated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想知道我是怎么知道的吗 - 你怎么知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wanna know how I know? - How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本不可能是故意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there's no such thing as cattle mutilation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果牛白天死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cow drops, leave it in the sun…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在48个小时之内 它的血液肯定会流干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}within 48 hours the bloat will split it open so clean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.69,0:04:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是基本的外科常识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just about surgical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,内脏里的血会流到地上 被土壤吸收掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bodily fluids fall down into the ground, get soaked up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有地心引力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because that's what gravity does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.95,0:04:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 但是传说恶魔也做同样的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey, it could be Satan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.29,0:04:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们刚才说为哪家报纸干活来着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What newspaper did you say you work for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.25,0:04:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 世界周刊 - 世界周刊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- World Weekly News. - Weekly World News.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 世界 - 世界周刊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- World - Weekly World.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界 我是新来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}World I'm new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我滚出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰 - 杰夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John. - Jeff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫 恩 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff, I know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,考特医生要你现在就去他的办公室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Dworkin needs to see you in his office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不是正在度假吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Dr. Dworkings on vacation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.19,0:05:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回来了 而且正在气头上 他吵着叫你过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's back and he's pissed. He's screaming for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果换了我是你 我就…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if I were you, I would…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些在佛罗里达的恶魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those Satanists in Florida{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会在牺牲的祭品上做记号 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they marked their victims?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 前额上会有个倒五角星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Reverse pentacle on the forehead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来佛罗里达发生的案子还真不少啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much F'd up crap happens in Florida.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 打开它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个懦夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wuss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有五角星的标记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no pentagram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可怜的女孩 - 也许我们应该看看她的嘴里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. Poor girl. - Maybe we should look in her mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看她喉咙里是不是有什么古怪的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if those wackos stuffed anything down her throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.11,0:06:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就象 沉默的羔羊 一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, kind of like the moth in Silence of the Lambs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那试试看吧 - 这次该你来干了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah, go ahead. - No, you go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 这好象并没那么难吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Put the lotion in the basket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 我承认是胆小鬼好了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah, I'm the wuss, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.96,0:06:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 给我一个桶 - 找到什么了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, get me a bucket. - Find something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.01,0:06:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我要吐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm gonna puke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.27,0:06:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 再把她的嘴弄开看看 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, lift her lip up again. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是不是想让我吐出来 - 没有 我好象看到了些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want me to throw up. - No, no, no. I think I saw something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.95,0:06:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不是有个洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that, a hole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是牙齿 - 萨姆 那是獠牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a tooth. - Sam, that's a fang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:07:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,平时藏着的吸血鬼的獠牙 你这是在开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A retractable set of vampire fangs. You gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来事情有些复杂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this changes things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最近怎么样 - 生活象梦那么美好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's it going? - Living the dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.24,0:07:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想要点什么 - 两杯啤酒 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What can I get for you? - Two beers, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.16,0:07:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想要找人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're looking for some people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 单身的滋味不好过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. It's hard to be lonely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 但我不是那个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but that's not what I meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 这些人应该搬到这里不到6个月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, so these people, they would've moved here about six months ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:08:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能比较粗暴 喜欢喝酒 - 都是些夜猫子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Probably pretty rowdy, like to drink. - Yeah, real night owls, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,白天睡觉 晚上出来狂欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep all day, party all night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克农场前些日子被租了出去 大赚了一笔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barker Farm got leased out a couple months ago. Real winners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人常到这里喝酒 吵杂的很{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been in here a lot. Drinkers. Noisy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有警告过他们一两次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had to eighty six them once or twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 张开你的嘴 - 你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smile. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我们看看你的牙齿 - 为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Show us those pearly whites. - For the love of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得相信我不是你们想找的 我不是吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna stick that thing someplace else? I'm not a vampire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我说实话 我在酒吧听见你们说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right. I heard you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还知道关于吸血鬼的其他事吗 - 杀掉它们的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you know about vampires? - How to kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 这刀子真的让我不爽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, seriously, bro, that knife's making me itch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 放轻松 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Whoa, easy there, Chachi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了吗 没有吸血鬼的牙齿吧 可以放过我了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Fangless. Happy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特和迪恩·温彻斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean Winchester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.11,0:10:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过你们的父亲 真是个了不起的猎人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met your old man once. Hell of a guy. Great hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说他死了 我很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard he passed. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's big shoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我又听说你们俩继承了他的事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But from what I hear, you guys fill them. Great trackers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是了不起的猎人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good in a tight spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看来你们很了解我们家族 - 消息传的很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seem to know a lot about our family. - Word travels fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道猎人之间是怎么说起你们家族的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how hunters talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.97,0:10:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we don't, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.59,0:10:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想大概你们父亲没有告诉你们过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess there's a lot your dad never told you, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.59,0:10:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.43,0:10:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个吸血鬼 都是你在盯着吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So those two vampires, they were yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.47,0:10:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 两周前他们来到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Been here two weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有去看过那巴克农场吗 - 那里只不过是一群嬉皮士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you check out that farm? - Just a bunch of hippie freaks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的那股味道能杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could kill you with that patchouli smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼的老巢在哪里呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the nest, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:10:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直藏着这些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this one covered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会 见到你们我很高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong, it's a real pleasure meeting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我追这些家伙有一年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've been on this thing for over a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.95,0:11:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在奥斯汀杀了一个吸血鬼 追踪到了这里的巢穴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed a fang back in Austin, tracked the nest here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会结束这些家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll finish it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能帮你 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We could help. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我比较喜欢一个人干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm a go it alone type of guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望能够参与其中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I've been itching for a hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.09,0:11:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 但我听说两州之外有个卓帕卡布拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. But, hey, I hear there's a chupacabra two states over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以去那看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead and knock yourselves out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你们真的很高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was real good meeting you, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.85,0:11:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,办完事后 我请你们喝酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll buy you a drink on the flip side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我非得请你们喝酒不可了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess I gotta buy you that drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我来请客 别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I got it. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要请你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No I insist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 宝贝 - 不客气 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, sweetie. - You're welcome. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又一个恶魔归于尘土 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Another one bites the dust. - That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.89,0:14:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.73,0:15:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你给那混蛋理了个新发型{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave that big ass fang one hell of a haircut, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 那还真不赖啊 绝对不赖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. - That was beautiful, absolutely beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 你还好吗 萨姆 - 我还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well… You all right, Sammy? - Yeah, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还好 放轻松点 萨姆 - 只有他能那么称呼我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, lighten up a little, Sammy. - He's the one who gets to call me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 没别的意思 只是想庆祝一下 这次干的不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. No offense meant. Just celebrating a little. Job well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.29,0:15:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但我没想要把他的头锯掉 这也不值得庆祝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, well, decapitations aren't my idea of a good time, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 伙计 他不是人 别那样斤斤计较了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, man. It's not like it was human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得找点乐子 - 这话我早就和他说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You gotta have fun with your job. - That's what I've been trying to tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得向他学学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could learn a thing or two from this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I bet I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不陪你们玩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not gonna bring you guys down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.43,0:15:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得回旅馆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna go back to the motel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.19,0:15:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得来接我 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind me to beat that buzz kill out of you later, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说错话了吗 - 没有 他有时就那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something I said? - No, he just gets that way sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:15:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.83,0:16:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你喝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}match of Quarters for the next round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我捡起弓朝那丑鬼射去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I pick up this crossbow, and I hit that ugly sucker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.85,0:16:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,镶银的箭正中它的心脏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a silver - tipped arrow right in his heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 那时正呆在车子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy's waiting in the car…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我父亲把那怪物拖进森林里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and me and my dad take the thing into the woods…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧掉了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and burn it to a crisp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就坐在哪里 看着那堆大火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sitting there, and I'm looking into the fire. I'm thinking to myself:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在想 我才16岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm 16 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,象我年纪的孩子都还在担心考试什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids my age are worried about pimples, prom dates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我这样的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm seeing things that they'll never even know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能想都没想到过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never even dream of."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以那时 我真的 - 从没享受过童年吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So right then, I just sort of - Embraced the life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:17:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 真惨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候开始猎鬼的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get started?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.23,0:17:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次看到吸血鬼时 我才18岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time I saw a vampire, I was barely 18.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我和我妹妹在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home alone with my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.11,0:17:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见她房间的窗户破了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear the window break in her room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿了我父亲的枪 跑进去 想赶走它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grab my dad's gun, run in. Try to get it off her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但太晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.12,0:17:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我开枪射了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I shoot the damn thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然这对它来说 就象隔靴搔痒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is about as useful as snapping it with a rubber band.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它转向我 把我抓起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It rushes me, picks me up, flings me across the room…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我扔到了房间的另一头 我昏了过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}knocks me out cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我醒来的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I wake up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那吸血鬼已经走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the vampire's gone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹也死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my sister is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.60,0:17:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把那消息告诉了你的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try explaining that one to your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.31,0:17:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开家…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I left home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处找关于它的信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then bummed around, looking for information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.23,0:17:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你们是如何追踪它们 如何杀了它们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you track them, how you kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而后我找到了那个吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I found that fang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:18:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我第一次猎鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my first kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到你妹妹的事我很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.74,0:18:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然能看得到她 即使她不在了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still see her, you know? The way she was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是很久以前的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey, that was a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 你爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.43,0:18:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走的太快了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotta be rough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.81,0:18:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是猎鬼者中的最勇敢的一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know, he was just one of those guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使身处险境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took some terrible beatings…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会勇往直前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just kept coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我常对自己说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're always saying to yourself, you know:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.15,0:18:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是无所不能的 他就在我们身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He's indestructible. He'll always be around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么能够杀了我的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can kill my dad."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.45,0:18:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就象…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just like that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去远行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.71,0:18:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对萨姆不能这样说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't talk about this to Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得装成没什么事一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I gotta keep my game face on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.59,0:19:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.22,0:19:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我掩饰地的并不怎么好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the truth is, I'm not handling it very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.31,0:19:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我感觉就象 - 内心有个黑洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Feel like I have this - Hole inside you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这股复仇的力量正变地越来越强大 欲望也愈发地强烈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it just gets bigger and bigger and darker and darker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你要好好利用它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. You can use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,激发你的欲望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps you hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 你的确需要杀戮 那会让你恢复过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, there's plenty out there needs killing and this'll help you do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你所干的并不是犯罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's not a crime to need your job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里是海里得旅馆 - 你好 埃伦 我是萨姆·温彻斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Harvelle's Roadhouse. - Hey, Ellen, Sam Winchester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 听到你的声音真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, it's good to hear from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们都还好吧 - 还好 一切都还不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You boys are okay, aren't you? - Yeah. Yeah, everything's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.85,0:19:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有个问题 - 说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got a question. - Yeah, shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有遇到过一个叫戈登·沃克的家伙吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever run across a guy named Gordon Walker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我认识戈登 - 还有呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I know Gordon. - And?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.19,0:19:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个不错的猎人 为什么你要问这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a real good hunter. Why you asking, sweetie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们碰到他了 我们正和他一起干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran into him on a job and we're kind of working with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.53,0:20:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那样做 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.95,0:20:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说他是个不错的猎人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said he was a good hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.95,0:20:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 精神医师汉尼拔告诉我关于他的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Hannibal Lecter's a good psychiatrist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他非常危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he is dangerous to everyone and everything around him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他在干什么 千万别和他混在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's working on a job, let him handle it, and move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃伦 - 不 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ellen - No, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请听我的 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just listen to what I'm telling you, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道我为什么这么享受生命吗 - 恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Know why I love this life? - Hm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界只有黑和白 没有中间的状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all black and white. There's no maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.89,0:20:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了恶魔 毁灭它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find the bad thing, kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数人一生在模棱两可两可中生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, most people spend their lives in shades of gray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个对吗 哪个不行吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this right, is that wrong? Not us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.23,0:20:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我们 萨姆不一定同意你的看法 但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure Sammy would agree with you, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟看起来和我们不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't seem like your brother's much like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.32,0:20:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说他不对 只是和我们不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying he's wrong, just different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你 我们生来就是做这个的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, we were born to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液里的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in our blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.33,0:22:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 伊利亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step back, Eli.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫勒诺 我不想伤害你 我只想和你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Lenore. I'm not gonna hurt you. We just need to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.59,0:23:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈吗 好啊 来啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk? Yeah, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.17,0:23:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得好好集中精力听听你怎么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I might have a tough time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.98,0:23:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得提防伊利亚的獠牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}paying attention to much besides Eli's teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我的话在 他不会伤害你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't hurt you. You have my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.72,0:23:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的承诺 哦 不错啊 太谢谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your word? Oh, yeah, great. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 我无意冒犯 但我以前不是没见过女吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but you're not the first vampire I've met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和其它吸血鬼不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not like the others. We don't kill humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.98,0:23:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不杀害人类 也不吸取他们的血液{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't drink their blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.49,0:23:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很久前就没那么做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.81,0:23:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在和我开玩笑吗 - 请注意 在我们面前 你还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this, some kind of joke? - Notice you're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.45,0:23:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果我错了 那请纠正我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, correct me if I'm wrong here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不吸取血液 难道不会饿死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but shouldn't you be starving to death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.28,0:23:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吸牛血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've found other ways: cattle blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.99,0:23:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说来是你们杀掉了那些牛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're responsible for all the?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.12,0:23:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 那样对我们来说 很恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not ideal. In fact, it's disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.67,0:23:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但可以让我们活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But allows us to get by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.42,0:23:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 为什么你们要这么做 - 为了生存{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, why? - Survival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有死亡 没有失踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No deaths, no missing locals…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.09,0:23:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会发生象你们这样的猎人到处来找我们的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}no reason for people like you to come looking for people like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.26,0:23:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是混血种族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We blend in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.26,0:23:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这个族快灭绝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our kind is practically extinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.60,0:24:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上来说 我们也不是想象中那样 在食物链的最高端{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out we weren't as high up the food chain as we imagined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.73,0:24:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要泄露我们的事情给这个杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we explaining ourselves to this killer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.15,0:24:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊利亚 - 我们以牛血为生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eli. - We choke on cows' blood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.11,0:24:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此人们不用担惊受怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that none of them suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.98,0:24:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而今晚 他们杀害了康拉德 喝酒庆祝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, they murdered Conrad and celebrated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.44,0:24:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊利亚 够了 - 是的 伊利亚 够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eli, that's enough. - Yeah, Eli, that's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.36,0:24:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的都让它过去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's done is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.24,0:24:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们今晚离开这个小镇 - 那为什么带我来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're leaving this town. - Why did you bring me here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.95,0:24:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和我说这些事 相信我 - 我也不愿意这样对你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you even talking to me? - Believe me, I'd rather not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.37,0:24:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我了解你的做事方式 一旦你有了线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know your kind. Once you have the scent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.83,0:24:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会追踪到我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll keep tracking us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.88,0:24:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们躲到那里都无济于事 猎手们会发现我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter where we go. Hunters will find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.84,0:24:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你求我们别再追杀你们 - 我们有生存的权利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're asking us not to follow? - We have a right to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们也没伤害别人 - 好吧 你可以继续口舌生花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not hurting anyone. - Right, so you keep saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.38,0:24:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是给我个相信你们的理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But give me one good reason why I should believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.97,0:24:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我要做什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm going to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.35,0:24:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会放了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to let you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.40,0:24:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带回去 不准动他一根毫毛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him back. Not a mark on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.89,0:25:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我测绘的最好的图了 虽然很粗糙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the best pattern I can establish. It's sketchy at best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.23,0:25:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来都是它们从小镇的这边过来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all coming from this side of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.32,0:25:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着这个巢穴就离这里不远 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nest would be around here, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.44,0:25:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我也这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what I'm thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.40,0:25:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 那里这样的农场有三四十个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem is there's 35, 40 farms out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.95,0:25:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搜查了它们中的一半 没找到任何线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've searched about half of them already, but nothing yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.33,0:25:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很善于掩盖踪迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're covering their tracks real good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.20,0:25:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们不得不搜查剩下的一半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we'll just have to search the other half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.12,0:25:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,几点啦 萨姆还没回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it? Where is Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.63,0:25:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,车还在外面 散步去了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car's parked outside. Probably went for a walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.55,0:25:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看起来他满喜欢逛逛 - 是 他是有点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seems like the take a walk type. - Yeah, he is, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.64,0:26:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去那里呢 - 我能单独和你谈谈吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you been? - Can I talk to you alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.64,0:26:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意我耽误你一点时间吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind chilling out for a couple minutes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.15,0:26:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 也许我们得重新考虑这次行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we gotta rethink this hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.07,0:26:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么 你去那里呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.91,0:26:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在它们的巢穴 - 你找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the nest. - You found it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.24,0:26:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到了我 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found me, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.41,0:26:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么出来的 你杀了几个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get out? How many did you kill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.50,0:26:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.66,0:26:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们可不会就这么放你走 - 可他们就是这么做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They didn't just let you go. - That's what they did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.67,0:26:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那好 他们在那里 - 我的眼睛给蒙起来了 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, well, where is it? - I was blindfolded. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.38,0:26:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总会知道点什么吧 - 我们经过了镇外的那座桥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You gotta know something. - We went over that bridge outside of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.51,0:26:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许我们不该去追杀他们 - 为什么不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe we shouldn't go after them. - Why not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.47,0:26:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们和其他的吸血鬼不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think they're like other vampires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.76,0:26:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们也不杀人 - 你开玩笑吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think they're killing people. - You're joking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.60,0:26:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们怎么活下来 他们算是那门子吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how do they stay alive or undead, whatever the hell they are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.93,0:26:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些牛 他们依靠动物的血活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cattle mutilations. They live off of animal blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.10,0:26:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你相信他们的鬼话 - 看看我 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you believed them? - Look at me, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.69,0:26:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没碰我一下就让我走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They let me go without a scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.94,0:26:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你就这么想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so you're saying…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.70,0:27:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 伙计 我不信 我不知道他们为什么要你走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man. No way. I don't know why they let you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.53,0:27:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不关心 我们去找它们 然后动手做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really care. We find them and we waste them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.70,0:27:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.20,0:27:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不是没有遇到过吸血鬼 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What part of "vampires" don't you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.62,0:27:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它是超自然的东西 我们就杀死它 这是我们的职责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's supernatural, we kill it. That's our job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.21,0:27:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 迪恩 这不是我们的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean, that is not our job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.67,0:27:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是惩罚邪恶的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our job is hunting evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.22,0:27:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不伤害人类 他们并不坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if these things aren't killing people, they're not evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.76,0:27:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当然危害人类 他们一直那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course they're killing people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.63,0:27:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是一样的 萨姆 他们并不是人类 好不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all the same, Sam. They're not human, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.35,0:27:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得追杀他们中的每一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to exterminate them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.89,0:27:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 迪恩 我不这么认为 这次的情况不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean. I don't think so, all right? Not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.89,0:27:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登跟踪这些吸血鬼一年多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon's been on those vamps for a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.60,0:27:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他了解情况 - 戈登 你相信他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He knows. - Gordon? You're taking his word for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.48,0:27:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 埃伦说他不是好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. - Ellen says he's bad news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.07,0:27:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和埃伦打电话了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called Ellen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.48,0:27:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就该无条件相信她吗 我们根本就不了解她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm supposed to listen to her? We barely know her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.19,0:27:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 我决定和戈登一起去 - 那好吧 戈登把你哄成那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, thanks. I'll go with Gordon. - Because Gordon's such an old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.78,0:27:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认为我不了解事情的真相吗 - 你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't think I can see what this is? - What are you talking about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.37,0:27:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个死掉的家伙不过是你对爸爸的死的发泄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a substitute for Dad, isn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.58,0:27:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个可怜的人 - 闭嘴 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A poor one. - Shut up, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.33,0:27:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的死对你来说就象是在昨天 - 我甚至不想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not even close. Not on his best day. - I'm not even gonna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.62,0:27:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脸上装出那副笑容 可我了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You slap on this fake smile, but I can see through it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.59,0:27:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的感受 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I know how you feel, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.25,0:28:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸死了 就象一个黑洞 无时不刻在刺痛你的心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's dead, and he left a hole and it hurts so bad you can't take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.26,0:28:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能因为这个 就乱杀无辜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't just fill up that hole with whoever you want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.43,0:28:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是对我们心中的老爸的侮辱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an insult to his memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.39,0:28:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.78,0:28:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以随便打我 来啊 但那不能改变什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can hit me all you want. It won't change anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.57,0:28:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去那个巢穴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to that nest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.91,0:28:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不告诉我在那里 没关系 我自己来找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna tell me where it is, fine. I'll find it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.96,0:28:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.79,0:28:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.46,0:28:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他应该出去找他们了吧 - 很可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think he went after them? - Probably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.63,0:28:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得阻止他 - 真的吗 因为我们说过要出手帮他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to stop him. - Really? Because I say we lend a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.76,0:28:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连怀疑的权利都没有了吗 你欠我这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me the benefit of the doubt, would you? You owe me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.27,0:28:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我们走着瞧 我来开车 给我钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll see. I'll drive. Give me the keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.65,0:28:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他偷走了钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He snaked the keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.65,0:28:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.32,0:29:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚刚把它修好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just fixed her up too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.66,0:29:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你就只记得那座桥了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bridge, is that all you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.62,0:29:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,从他们的农场到达桥那只需要四分半钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bridge was four and a half minutes from their farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.50,0:29:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道 - 我心里记着数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know? - I counted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.83,0:29:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了农场左转 然后 右转上了条泥土路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took a left out of the farm, then turned right onto a dirt road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.96,0:29:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着开了两分钟 爬了点小坡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Followed that for two minutes, slightly uphill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.34,0:29:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后右急转 我们就到了桥边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then took another quick right and we hit the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.09,0:29:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真不懒啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.18,0:29:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你这家伙老是惹来麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monster pain in the ass…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.64,0:29:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不得不说你还是很厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.86,0:29:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿去放在卡车里 谢谢 - 我们不能就这么离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the truck, thank you. - We can't leave like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.62,0:29:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,勒诺 听我说 我们要留下来 和他们战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lenore, listen to me. We need to stay and fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.54,0:29:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也是我的朋友们 我的家人 伊利亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were my friends too, Eli. My family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.83,0:29:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说这个 这是自卫 反击或者被杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I'm talking about.This is self defense.Kill or be killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.00,0:30:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死了就不能伤害我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't hunt us if they're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.09,0:30:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀害那三个猎人不会解决任何问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing those three wouldn't solve anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.09,0:30:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有更多的猎人来找我们 我们远远少于他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more where they came from. We're outnumbered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.59,0:30:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all we can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.22,0:30:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尝试和他们沟通 说服 - 你不可能说服他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Try and reason with - You can't reason with these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.56,0:30:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们始终还是要杀掉我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna kill us all anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.65,0:30:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们至少能和他们同归于尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should at least take a few of them with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.36,0:30:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放弃希望的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving up hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.74,0:30:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能改变 为什么他们不能接受呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can change, they can change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.49,0:30:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去镇里集合其他人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, go into town and gather the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.37,0:30:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出前我们出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave before sunrise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.21,0:32:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人的血液 婊子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead man's blood, bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.54,0:32:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 迪恩 进来啊 - 戈登 怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, Dean, come on in. - Hey, Gordon, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.88,0:32:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在用死人的血液在折磨她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just poisoning Lenore here with some dead man's blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.80,0:32:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会交代出其他人的 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna tell us where all her friends are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.55,0:32:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想来试试吗 - 听着 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wanna help? - Look, man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.06,0:33:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿把刀来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab a knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.22,0:33:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚想从另外一只手开始我的游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just about to start in on the fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.65,0:33:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 喔 喔 喔 这让人起鸡皮疙瘩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, hey, let's all just chill out, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.07,0:33:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我早就没感觉了 - 戈登 放下手里的刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm completely chill. - Gordon, put the knife down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.74,0:33:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来萨姆看不下去了哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like it's Sammy that needs to chill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.99,0:33:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开她 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just step away from her, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.83,0:33:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.46,0:33:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我套不出什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wasting my time here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.67,0:33:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个婊子嘴巴硬得很{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bitch will never talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.63,0:33:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许让她摆脱痛苦是最好的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might as well put her out of her misery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.47,0:33:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这刀我刚磨过 对她来说也算是仁慈了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just sharpened it, so it's completely humane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.68,0:33:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戈登 我要放开她 - 你不能那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gordon, I'm letting her go. - You're not doing a damn thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.60,0:33:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 戈登 我们来聊聊好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. Gordon, let's talk about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.77,0:33:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好说的 就象我说的 黑白中间没有灰色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's there to talk about? It's like I said, Dean, no shades of gray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.77,0:33:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我听你说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.19,0:33:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也知道你的感受 - 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I know how you feel. - Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.19,0:33:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死你妹妹的吸血鬼是该死 但是… 。-{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vampire that killed your sister deserved to die. But this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.12,0:34:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死我的妹妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed my sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.16,0:34:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个邪恶的吸血鬼并没有那么做 他感染了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That filthy fang didn't kill my sister. It turned her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.08,0:34:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她也成为了吸血鬼中的一员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made her one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.12,0:34:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我追查着她的下落 也亲手结果了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I hunted her down and I killed her myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.67,0:34:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你做了什么 - 那不再是我的妹妹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You did what? - Wasn't my sister anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.88,0:34:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她根本不是人类 我没有犹豫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't human. I didn't blink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.80,0:34:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,您们也不应该犹豫 所以 其实你是了解事实的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither would you. So you knew all along, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.30,0:34:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们不杀害人类 你知道他们没有杀任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew about the vampires. You knew they weren't killing anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.60,0:34:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那些牛的死因 只是你根本不关心这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew about the cattle, and you just didn't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,关心什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Care about what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.69,0:34:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼们突然变成了好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nest of vampires suddenly acting nice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.15,0:34:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了吸食人类的血液外还做点其它的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking a little time out from sucking people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.52,0:34:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就得放过他们 相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're supposed to buy that? Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.03,0:34:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本没有改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't change what they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.32,0:34:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能证明给你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can prove it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.16,0:34:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.63,0:34:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上 - 放松点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now! - Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.50,0:34:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想杀他 他早就没命了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wanted to kill him, he'd already be on the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.84,0:34:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是让你们了解真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just making a little point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.52,0:35:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.15,0:35:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和其它吸血鬼有什么不同吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she's so different?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.94,0:35:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想救她吗 看看她现在这个样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still wanna save her? Look at her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.16,0:35:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是一样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.08,0:35:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶 渴望血液{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil, bloodthirsty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.08,0:35:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.76,0:35:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了没 戈登{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear her, Gordon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.97,0:35:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.43,0:35:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们停止吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.23,0:35:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 带她出去 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, get her out of here. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.31,0:35:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.07,0:36:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.57,0:36:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们有点事要谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you and I got some things to talk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拦着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.09,0:36:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 其实你也不想保护她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - You're not serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.26,0:36:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很难相信这一切 但当我了解了真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having a hard time believing it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.00,0:36:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know what I saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.93,0:36:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想对那些吸血鬼做什么 得先过我这关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want those vampires, you gotta go through me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.32,0:36:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.34,0:37:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么 伙计 你在保护一个吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, man? You're doing this for a fang?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.97,0:37:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 迪恩 我们是在一条战线上的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean. We're on the same side here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.30,0:37:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 你这个虐待狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so, you sadistic bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.77,0:37:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会象你的弟弟那样 你是和我一样的杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not like your brother. You're a killer. Like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.51,0:37:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对不起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.43,0:37:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.43,0:37:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能象你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might be like you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.89,0:37:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也可能不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I might not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.36,0:38:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你才是那个绑着动不了的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're the one tied up right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.61,0:38:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错过了什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.82,0:38:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.45,0:38:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 勒诺没事了吧 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lenore get out okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.24,0:38:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.87,0:39:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们的工作做完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I guess our work here is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.38,0:39:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样啊 戈登{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, Gordy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.88,0:39:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不服气吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta tinkle yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.80,0:39:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.72,0:39:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, get comfy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.59,0:39:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天后 我们会打电话叫人来 放开你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll call someone in two or three days, have them come out, untie you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.23,0:39:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to go, Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.10,0:39:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.57,0:39:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 我还是说句再见吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess this is goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.78,0:39:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 真心的告别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's been real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.13,0:39:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 这下终于舒坦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm good now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.96,0:39:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.85,0:40:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.73,0:40:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 打我一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clock me one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.19,0:40:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 来 快来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.65,0:40:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会还手的 来啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't even hit you back. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.87,0:40:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.28,0:40:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 痛快点 随你 来啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. You get a freebie. Hit me. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.25,0:40:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在灰头土脸的 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you just went 12 rounds with a block of cement, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.04,0:40:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后我再还你这一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take a rain check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.92,0:40:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望我们从没做过这个 从没发现这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish we never took this job. It's jacked everything up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.47,0:40:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.72,0:40:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想我们的生活 我们猎杀的种种经历{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about the hunts we went on, our whole lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.43,0:40:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恩 - 如果我们杀错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - What if we killed things…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.31,0:40:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 爸爸一直教育我们那样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that didn't deserve killing? I mean, the way Dad raised us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.69,0:40:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 在妈妈死后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, after what happened to Mom…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.69,0:40:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸已经做到最好了 - 我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …Dad did the best he could. - I know he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.95,0:40:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也许他并不那么完美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the man wasn't perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.91,0:40:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他教导我们的方式 痛恨所有的鬼魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the way he raised us to hate those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.32,0:40:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确也是那么觉得 我坚信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, man, I hate them. I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.25,0:41:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在伐木场杀掉那个吸血鬼的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I killed that vampire at the mill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.91,0:41:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有怎么想 我甚至喜欢那种杀戮的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even think about it. Hell, I even enjoyed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.67,0:41:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你放过了勒诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't kill Lenore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.67,0:41:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是我的本能告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but every instinct told me to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.72,0:41:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该动手杀她 我想杀掉她 消灭他们全部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna kill her. I was gonna kill them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.55,0:41:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 可是你没那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dean, but you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.43,0:41:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.47,0:41:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.39,0:41:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你对我来说是个大麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because you're a pain in my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.11,0:41:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 对你来说 可能得一直接受我这个麻烦下去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I might have to stick around and be a pain in the ass, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.86,0:41:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.86,0:41:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mention it.{\r}
